  "caveats": [
    "DBと開発元の根拠・日時・範囲は出典別に保持する。",
    "実悪用とCISA KEVは未確認。未確認は悪用なし・未掲載を意味しない。",
    "The official security page and CycloneDX VDR agree on the bridge artifact and alpha1 lower bound. The new Reviewed record names log4j-core and starts its 3.x range at beta1. Preserve both source-specific values rather than asserting their equivalence.",
    "The bridge class delegates sanitization to Transform in log4j-core. Merged official fix PR 4078 changes the core implementation and tests in both core and bridge, so the DB package change is not proven to be a typo. Do not discard core solely because the security page names bridge.",
    "Only users configuring Log4j1XmlLayout directly or selecting the compatibility XMLLayout route are described by this advisory. Do not generalize to every logging path.",
    "The 3.x maximum is inclusive beta2; the official advisory supplies no 3.x fixed version. Do not invent a fix from a subsequent beta.",
    "Official CVSS4.0 6.9/medium has the same vector as Reviewed. Vendor exact timestamps are distinct from database publication/update timestamps."
  ],
